<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6822" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακτέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must bring up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέγμα διὰ τοῦ στόματος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Dent.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one must refer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν ὕλην τὰς αἰτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					778b1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>one must reduce, bring back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν παλαιὰν ἀταξίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nob.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
